# IPv4 / IGMPv3 Membership Report fixture with generic RFC 9279 extension data.
# RFC 9776 defines the report and group-record body, RFC 9279 defines the E flag
# and 16-bit Type / 16-bit Length / raw Value extension TLV area, and RFC 9778
# keeps IGMP/MLD extension codepoints under IANA policy. Type 0xfffe is
# reserved for experimental use and remains byte-preserving. Source and group
# addresses use documentation space; this is not live traffic.
45 00 00 32 17 12 00 00 01 02 00 51 c0 00 02 51 e0 00 00 16
22 00 6b 5d 00 00 00 00 80 00 00 01 01 00 00 01 e9 fc 00 51
cb 00 71 51 ff fe 00 02 ca fe
